@host = http://localhost:8080

### Cadastrar membro
POST {{host}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Souza",
  "email": "ana.souza@ufape.edu.br"
}

### Cadastrar membro com e-mail repetido, espera 409
POST {{host}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana S.",
  "email": "ana.souza@ufape.edu.br"
}

### Cadastrar membro invalido, espera 400
POST {{host}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "nao-e-email"
}

### Listar membros
GET {{host}}/members

### Buscar membro
GET {{host}}/members/1

### Atualizar membro
PUT {{host}}/members/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Souza Lima",
  "email": "ana.souza@ufape.edu.br"
}

### Cadastrar livro
POST {{host}}/items/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert Martin",
  "isbn": "9780132350884"
}

### Cadastrar revista
POST {{host}}/items/magazines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Superinteressante",
  "publisher": "Abril",
  "edition": 450
}

### Listar itens
GET {{host}}/items

### Listar itens disponiveis
GET {{host}}/items/available

### Registrar emprestimo
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "itemId": 1
}

### Registrar emprestimo do mesmo item, espera 409
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "itemId": 1
}

### Listar emprestimos
GET {{host}}/loans

### Registrar devolucao
PUT {{host}}/loans/1/return

### Registrar devolucao de novo, espera 409
PUT {{host}}/loans/1/return

### Remover membro com emprestimo ativo, espera 409
DELETE {{host}}/members/1

### Remover item
DELETE {{host}}/items/1

### ==================== Terceira VA ====================

### Reservar um item disponivel, espera 409
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "itemId": 1
}

### Reservar um item emprestado, espera 201
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 2,
  "itemId": 1
}

### Reservar de novo para o mesmo membro, espera 409
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 2,
  "itemId": 1
}

### Listar reservas
GET {{host}}/reservations

### Buscar reserva
GET {{host}}/reservations/1

### Cancelar reserva
PUT {{host}}/reservations/1/cancel

### Cancelar de novo, espera 409
PUT {{host}}/reservations/1/cancel

### Emprestar item reservado por outro membro, espera 409
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "itemId": 1
}

### Registrar multa por dano
POST {{host}}/fines/damages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": 1,
  "severity": "SEVERE"
}

### Registrar multa por dano de novo no mesmo emprestimo, espera 409
POST {{host}}/fines/damages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": 1,
  "severity": "LIGHT"
}

### Listar multas
GET {{host}}/fines

### Saldo devedor
GET {{host}}/fines/summary

### Emprestar para membro com multa em aberto, espera 409
POST {{host}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": 1,
  "itemId": 2
}

### Pagar multa
PUT {{host}}/fines/1/pay

### Pagar de novo, espera 409
PUT {{host}}/fines/1/pay
